 "notes": [
  "Posted 12 July 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "No starting section is posted. The strategy says to start Battle Order and then usually Imperial Arrest Order or Oppressive Enforcement; Prepared Defenses is in the list, so it is set as the starting interrupt. All are counted in their sections.",
  "Section headers (OBJ, FX, Places, People, Interupts, Jank, Boats) and the heading line 'Heart Attack, after games of playtesting...' are not cards.",
  "Posted 'A Million Voices Crying Out Loud' dested A Million Voices Crying Out; 'Mara, TEH' dested Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'U-3P0' dested U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'Admiral, Grand Thrawn' dested Grand Admiral Thrawn; 'Captain Gilad Pallaeon' dested Captain Gilad Pellaeon.",
  "Systems and sites dested the Dark printings: Alderaan (Dark), Death Star: Docking Bay 327 (Dark), Endor (Dark), Kashyyyk (Dark), Sullust (Dark).",
  "Oppressive Enforcement and Come Here You Big Coward were Effects in 2001 (not Defensive Shields).",
  "The strategy mentions a tournament the following week ('Read my TR next week'); no event or result is given, so it stays a general deck.",
  "Total is 60 as published."
